    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Today the only remnants of the once‑thriving industry are the crumbling coke oven ruins, a slate dump, and the town’s memories.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://coalcampusa.com/westpa/klondike/republic/republic.htm"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Republic sits on the western edge of Redstone Township in Fayette County, Pennsylvania.",
