      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republic%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Pennsylvania Route 166 cuts through Republic, heading north five miles to Brownsville and south six miles to Edenborn.",
